{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cozy hidden object game, you will explore the settlements of forest elves who are engaged in all sorts of cool activities. There are many cute and funny stories happening in the forest, you just need to look closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707120/extras/Unlock1.gif?t=1751233294\" /></div>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Key features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2753 <strong> Find over 500+ hidden objects: </strong> including elves, fireflies, berries, and much more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae 2 hand-drawn forest locations:</strong>  immerse yourself in two elf settlements, each with its own story.<br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong> Loop location: </strong> you can rotate the scene endlessly in a circle, however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong> Relaxing forest lo-fi soundtrack: </strong> gentle melodies will help you relax and immerse yourself in the atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong> Pleasant glow: </strong> found items are highlighted with a magical glow. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> \u2014 this will support our small indie team and help us continue to create the cozy games you love. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707120/extras/Elfs.gif?t=1751233294\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707120?t=1751233294","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707120?t=1751233294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707120/f84084721c36780417b73ba77446bae5eda861c6/capsule